  "notes": "pyproject.toml (lines 1-90) has no [project.optional-dependencies] table at all, so `.[test]` names a non-existent extra; the test tooling (pytest, pytest-recording, syrupy, httpx2-pytest, etc.) lives in the `dev` dependency group (lines 45-70), which uv includes by default and CI installs with `pip install . --group dev`. docs/contributing.md and the Justfile use `uv run pytest`. AGENTS.md's docs-build section (`cd docs; pip install -r requirements.txt; make html`) still refers to real files, but contributing.md prescribes `just docs`. Absence of the extra is shown by the full pyproject.toml rather than a single quotable line."
